# legacy_side.dsc - the 49 existing side quests' text (owner: S2; the
# quests49/ re-timing (S4) replaces it). The table itself stays in
# core/src/story_side.c; its strings are these ids (TXT_Q<n>_TITLE /
# _OFFER / _HINT / _THANKS, TXT_SS_<n>). lint=legacy: the old lines are
# longer than one box page and page automatically.
@pack legside kind=side lint=legacy

string Q0_TITLE "Mail Mix-Up"
string Q0_OFFER "Ribbit! A love letter for Valentina the matchmaker got stuck to my hat. Could you hop it over to her in the plaza?"
string Q0_HINT "Deliver the love letter to Valentina (plaza)"
string Q0_THANKS "She read it and fainted from joy! Wonderful! Here, a thank-you and a lovebird stamp. Ribbit!"
string Q1_TITLE "Coffee for Bluebell"
string Q1_OFFER "I've been up since dawn arranging tulips into the shape of a heart. I need coffee. Please. From the cafe."
string Q1_HINT "Bring Bluebell a Coffee (Brimstone Bites)"
string Q1_THANKS "*slurp* My petals are perking up! Take this tulip pin. I made it from a real tulip. Mostly."
string Q2_TITLE "Lost Kitten"
string Q2_OFFER "Woof! I was walking Sir Whiskers and he walked ME into a hedge and vanished! He likes high places. Up on the Lane?"
string Q2_HINT "Find Sir Whiskers the cat (Hillvile Lane)"
string Q2_THANKS "SIR WHISKERS! You little rascal! Thank you, thank you! Here's my dog-walking money."
string Q3_TITLE "Say Cheese!"
string Q3_OFFER "I'm making a postcard of HaHaland! Could you snap the giggling fountain for me? Stand right in front and press A!"
string Q3_HINT "Photograph the fountain in the plaza"
string Q3_THANKS "Oh, the sparkles! The lighting! You have the eye, darling. Here's your model fee."
string Q4_TITLE "Cupid's Little Helper"
string Q4_OFFER "Psst! Freckles has a HUGE crush on Skipper the paper kid. Give Freckles a little pep talk? She's in the park."
string Q4_HINT "Encourage Freckles to confess (park)"
string Q4_THANKS "Love is in the air! Or at least nervous giggling. Thanks, partner. Here, smell nice!"
string Q5_TITLE "Strong Bones"
string Q5_OFFER "Clack clack! I'm a xylophone teacher AND a xylophone. Two Milks keep these bones ringing true. Could you?"
string Q5_HINT "Bring Bonejangles 2 Milk"
string Q5_THANKS "*glug glug* Hear that? Perfect pitch! You've saved my tibia solo."
string Q6_TITLE "Bedtime Stories"
string Q6_OFFER "Hoo! The little ones want a new bedtime story. Would you check the Library for 'The Very Hungry Demon'?"
string Q6_HINT "Visit the Library in the park"
string Q6_THANKS "Hoo hoo! The kids will love it. It has a happy ending. Mostly. Take this, and a bookworm bookmark."
string Q7_TITLE "Ribbon Cutting"
string Q7_OFFER "I cut ribbons professionally! The Fun Fair's big top needs an official visitor before I can snip. Pop in?"
string Q7_HINT "Visit the Fun Fair big top"
string Q7_THANKS "SNIP! The Fun Fair is officially fun! Here, your official visitor fee."
string Q8_TITLE "Grandma's Glasses"
string Q8_OFFER "Dearie, I've lost my reading glasses! Last I saw them I was napping at the beach. Or was it 1974?"
string Q8_HINT "Find Oma Fluff's glasses (beach)"
string Q8_THANKS "Oh! I can see you now! You're lovely. Have a pudding, and my old locket. There's a cake in it."
string Q9_TITLE "Sandcastle Contest"
string Q9_OFFER "Duuude. I need a photo from the very end of the pier for the surf club wall. Gnarly view out there!"
string Q9_HINT "Photograph the view from the end of the pier"
string Q9_THANKS "Radical shot! You're officially in the surf club now, dude!"
string Q10_TITLE "Clean Sweep"
string Q10_OFFER "Blorp! I wash every window in Hillvile Towers. I'm out of soap and full of pride. Three Soaps, please!"
string Q10_HINT "Bring Squishy 3 Soap (shop)"
string Q10_THANKS "Sparkle sparkle! You can see your reflection in me now. Thanks, friend!"
string Q11_TITLE "Choir Practice"
string Q11_OFFER "HALLELUJAH! I mean, hello. The Concert Hall needs someone to test the echo. Go in and sing! Loudly!"
string Q11_HINT "Visit the Concert Hall"
string Q11_THANKS "I heard you from here! Beautiful! Terrible! Beautiful! Here's a hymn for your jukebox."
string Q12_TITLE "Smoke Signals"
string Q12_OFFER "The weather's all wrong. A purple cloud is sitting over Cloud Nine Vapor and it's NOT on my forecast. Photo, please?"
string Q12_HINT "Photograph the purple cloud at Cloud Nine Vapor"
string Q12_THANKS "Look at that cloud... it's SMILING. That's not meteorology. That's evil. Here, a storm chaser badge."
string Q13_TITLE "Steam Cleaning"
string Q13_OFFER "Poor Steamy smells like grape after his... ordeal. Bring him my lavender soap? It's very calming."
string Q13_HINT "Bring the lavender soap to Steamy (plaza)"
string Q13_THANKS "He's back at the bath house, humming! Real humming, not demon humming. Bless you!"
string Q14_TITLE "Holy Supplies"
string Q14_OFFER "The old scrolls warn of more possessions. We need Holy Water, two flasks. The church sells it, child."
string Q14_HINT "Bring Sr. Lumen 2 Holy Water"
string Q14_THANKS "Blessed be. Take this rosary: it once made a demon sneeze for an hour."
string Q15_TITLE "Scrap Science"
string Q15_OFFER "Squeak! I'm inventing a vapor detector! I just need three bits of scrap. Rivet sells some, or find it in fights!"
string Q15_HINT "Bring Prof. Fizz 3 Scrap"
string Q15_THANKS "EUREKA! It beeps! It beeps at everything! Take some gears for your welding."
string Q16_TITLE "Nervous Nellie"
string Q16_OFFER "My client Lagspike vaped ALL night on stream and now his chat is only screaming. Can you help him? Gently?"
string Q16_HINT "Exorcise Lagspike (near the graveyard)"
string Q16_THANKS "He's streaming cat videos again. Normal cat videos. Have a chill pill and a golden hug token."
string Q17_TITLE "No Vapes at Daycare"
string Q17_OFFER "Someone dropped a vape pen at the playground! The kids think it's a magic wand. Please find it before they do!"
string Q17_HINT "Find the dropped vape pen (playground)"
string Q17_THANKS "Got it? Into the bin it goes. Forever. Thank you, @P. The kids are safe."
string Q18_TITLE "A Taste of Home"
string Q18_OFFER "Don't laugh. I miss Hellvile candy. The shop sells Candy Eyeballs now. Two packs? For morale. Imp morale."
string Q18_HINT "Bring Rivet 2 Candy Eyeballs (shop)"
string Q18_THANKS "*crunch* ...Just like Mum's. Ahem. Thanks. Have some weld rods. Don't tell anyone I'm sentimental."
string Q19_TITLE "Knightly Hearts"
string Q19_OFFER "Dame Fluff and Valkyrie have been sparring for YEARS. It's obviously love. Go nudge Dame Fluff, darling!"
string Q19_HINT "Nudge Dame Fluff to confess (west lawn)"
string Q19_THANKS "They're holding paws! With gauntlets on! Take this ring, and my Cupid's Arrow pin."
string Q20_TITLE "Pip's Bravery Badge"
string Q20_OFFER "Mr. Flops wants a picture of the scary Wall! He's too scared. I'm NOT scared. You do it though."
string Q20_HINT "Photograph the Wall for Pip"
string Q20_THANKS "Whoa! Spooky! Mr. Flops fainted. Here's a plushie for being brave, and Mr. Flops ears!"
string Q21_TITLE "Fire Drill"
string Q21_OFFER "WOOF! A big brute demon is sitting on my fire hydrant! I'm a fire chief, not a demon chief! Help!"
string Q21_HINT "Defeat the brute by the plaza"
string Q21_THANKS "The hydrant is FREE! You're an honorary firefighter now, kid. Here's your badge."
string Q22_TITLE "Barricade the Bakery"
string Q22_OFFER "Sweet pea! The demons are after my sourdough starter! Three bits of scrap and I can barricade the cafe!"
string Q22_HINT "Bring Nana 3 Scrap"
string Q22_THANKS "Perfect! Nothing gets between Nana and her starter. Have some emergency cupcakes."
string Q23_TITLE "Medic!"
string Q23_OFFER "So many scrapes and singed fur. I'm running low. Two Medicine, please. My cold hands are steady, at least."
string Q23_HINT "Bring Dr. Bloom 2 Medicine"
string Q23_THANKS "Thank you. Everyone will be patched up. You look tired. Drink these. Doctor's orders."
string Q24_TITLE "Hymn of Hope"
string Q24_OFFER "Bellwether rang the bells too close to the cloud and now they toll BACKWARDS. Free her, please!"
string Q24_HINT "Exorcise Bellwether the bell ringer"
string Q24_THANKS "Listen! The bells ring forward again! Take some blessed salt for the road."
string Q25_TITLE "Mr. Biscuit"
string Q25_OFFER "*hic* Mr. Biscuit ran away when the sky went red! He's a puppy. He's THIS big. *gestures tiny*"
string Q25_HINT "Find Mr. Biscuit the puppy (by the graveyard)"
string Q25_THANKS "MR. BISCUIT! *hug* Thank you thank you thank you!"
string Q26_TITLE "Graveyard Shift"
string Q26_OFFER "Something with too many legs crawled out of the Fun Fair. Spiders made of cloud, child. Purge them."
string Q26_HINT "Clear the cloud spiders at the Fun Fair"
string Q26_THANKS "The children can play again. Take this salt and my old spider swatter medal, child."
string Q27_TITLE "Spire Scout"
string Q27_OFFER "My balloon got sucked toward that cloud tower! Get me a close-up photo so I can plan a rescue flight!"
string Q27_HINT "Photograph the foot of Cloud Nine Spire"
string Q27_THANKS "Oof. It's even uglier up close. Thanks! Here, my sky scout wings pin."
string Q28_TITLE "Stay Awake, Guards!"
string Q28_OFFER "The royal guard hasn't slept since the sky ripped. Two Energy Drinks and we'll hold the plaza till dawn!"
string Q28_HINT "Bring Valkyrie 2 Energy Drinks"
string Q28_THANKS "HUZZAH! The guard stands firm! Take this hellsteel we pried off a demon."
string Q29_TITLE "Comfort Food"
string Q29_OFFER "Hootenanny has been keeping night watch for three days straight. Bring him my onigiri? Extra pickle."
string Q29_HINT "Bring the onigiri to Hootenanny (west lawn)"
string Q29_THANKS "He ate it in one bite and said 'hoo'. That means thank you. Here's one for you too."
string Q30_TITLE "Save the Mascot"
string Q30_OFFER "Hugsley the town mascot breathed the cloud and now he hugs TOO HARD. Please exorcise him before he hugs a bus."
string Q30_HINT "Exorcise Hugsley the mascot (playground)"
string Q30_THANKS "He's back to normal hugs! Normal, wonderful hugs. Here, a balloon animal. It's a plushie. Close enough."
string Q31_TITLE "Postcard from the Fountain"
string Q31_OFFER "I write poems on the gate in chalk. I've never seen a fountain that giggles. Could you bring me a photo of one?"
string Q31_HINT "Photograph HaHaland's fountain for Clinker"
string Q31_THANKS "A fountain... that laughs. I'm going to write forty poems about this. Thank you."
string Q32_TITLE "Charcoal Cookies"
string Q32_OFFER "I baked for Nana Pudding! The famous Nana Pudding! They're only a little bit charcoal. Would you deliver them?"
string Q32_HINT "Bring Charlotte's bagels to Nana Pudding"
string Q32_THANKS "She said they were 'crunchy and full of love'! She wants to swap recipes! Have some angel cake!"
string Q33_TITLE "The Florist's Apprentice"
string Q33_OFFER "Shh. I want to be a florist. A HILLVILE florist. Could you ask Bluebell if she'd take a ghoul apprentice?"
string Q33_HINT "Ask Bluebell to take Morguelet as an apprentice"
string Q33_THANKS "She said YES?! I'm going to cry black tears of joy. Here, flowers, and a flower friend ribbon!"
string Q34_TITLE "Game Night"
string Q34_OFFER "I lowered the rent for the families in my crypts. Now the kids need something fun. A board game, maybe?"
string Q34_HINT "Bring Graveley a Board Game"
string Q34_THANKS "Ha! The little ghouls will play for a century. Thank you. Don't tell anyone I'm nice."
string Q35_TITLE "Lullaby for Clouds"
string Q35_OFFER "I hum lullabies to the clouds I haul. I've heard Hillvile has a Concert Hall. Could you go hear it for me?"
string Q35_HINT "Visit HaHaland's Concert Hall for Ploddy"
string Q35_THANKS "Real music. In a real hall. The clouds will sleep so well tonight. Thank you, friend."
string Q36_TITLE "Squeaky Toy Diplomacy"
string Q36_OFFER "GRR. Nobody gets into the Arena without a squeaky toy. Rules is rules. ...Can I keep it after?"
string Q36_HINT "Bring Big Snarl a Plushie"
string Q36_THANKS "*squeak squeak squeak* ...Ahem. You're on the list. FOREVER. Have a steak."
string Q37_TITLE "Last Puff"
string Q37_OFFER "My friend Hazey still heralds Vapula's smoke. He can't stop. Something's still inside him. Please?"
string Q37_HINT "Exorcise Hazey the smoke herald"
string Q37_THANKS "He coughed out the last of it and then he SANG. My friend is back! Thank you!"
string Q38_TITLE "Counting Together"
string Q38_OFFER "I counted days for ten years. They say a clockmaker in Hillvile counts seconds. Would he count with me?"
string Q38_HINT "Introduce Tallyworn to Tock the clockmaker"
string Q38_THANKS "He said yes! Every day at noon, we count together. One. Two. Three. Thank you."
string Q39_TITLE "Echo of the Duke"
string Q39_OFFER "Sniff sniff. There's still an echo of Vapula's stink up in that Spire. A real champion would clear it out."
string Q39_HINT "Clear the echo of Vapula from the Spire"
string Q39_THANKS "You smell like victory! And smoke. Mostly victory. Take this champion's buckle, champ."
string Q40_TITLE "Rival Bakers"
string Q40_OFFER "Crumbelina the royal baker said my marshmallows were 'a crime'. Could you... make peace for me?"
string Q40_HINT "Make peace between Scorchmello and Crumbelina"
string Q40_THANKS "A bake-off! She challenged me to a FRIENDLY bake-off! Have some of her cupcakes, they're incredible."
string Q41_TITLE "Squeak the Bat"
string Q41_OFFER "*sniffle* My pet bat Squeak flew off when the gate opened! He likes the lake shore. I bit someone. Sorry."
string Q41_HINT "Find Squeak the bat by the Lake of Fire"
string Q41_THANKS "SQUEAK! *happy chomp* Oops, sorry. Here, you're officially a bat buddy!"
string Q42_TITLE "Wall Art"
string Q42_OFFER "I painted hearts on the Wall every night for years. Before they knock it down, could you photograph them?"
string Q42_HINT "Photograph the hearts on the Wall gate"
string Q42_THANKS "My hearts will live forever in that picture. Here, a wall artist ribbon. You've earned it."
string Q43_TITLE "Encore!"
string Q43_OFFER "That festival was the best gig of my un-life. Get up on the Unity Stage and give 'em an encore!"
string Q43_HINT "Visit the Unity Stage for an encore"
string Q43_THANKS "ENCORE! ENCORE! You rock, Hillvile! Take the festival anthem for your jukebox."
string Q44_TITLE "Frog Wedding"
string Q44_OFFER "Warty sings love songs to the moon. Lily Lou grows lilies for the pond. A cross-border frog wedding! Nudge him?"
string Q44_HINT "Nudge Warty to confess to Lily Lou"
string Q44_THANKS "A wedding! A WEDDING! The first cross-border wedding in Hellvile Park! Have a ring and my planner pin!"
string Q45_TITLE "The Big Picture"
string Q45_OFFER "Darling, I need the shot of the century: the river, both sides, no Wall. Stand on the bridge and snap it!"
string Q45_HINT "Photograph the park from the north bridge"
string Q45_THANKS "No Wall in the frame. Just people. It's the most beautiful thing I've ever developed."
string Q46_TITLE "Potluck Planner"
string Q46_OFFER "My potluck is open to everyone now. Everyone! I need more soup. Two Soul Soups from the market, dear?"
string Q46_HINT "Bring Mother Nox 2 Soul Soup (Hellvile market)"
string Q46_THANKS "Splendid. Hillvile brought cake and we brought soup. That is diplomacy. Have some cake."
string Q47_TITLE "Vapula's Apology"
string Q47_OFFER "...*tiny wheeze* I'm... smaller now. Humbler. Could you give these flowers to your Mayor? With my apology?"
string Q47_HINT "Bring Vapula's apology flowers to the Mayor (stage)"
string Q47_THANKS "He forgave me. He HUGGED me. I didn't know a cloud could feel this... dry-eyed. Thank you."
string Q48_TITLE "Explorer's Club"
string Q48_OFFER "As scout leader I MUST know: what do they sell at the Hellvile imp market? Go look! For science! For badges!"
string Q48_HINT "Visit the imp market in Hellvile"
string Q48_THANKS "Spicy peppers and eyeball candy?! Incredible. You've earned the Cross-Border Explorer badge!"
string SS_1 "For me? Oh! Thank you so much! Please tell them I said so!"
string SS_2 "You think I should tell @T how I feel? ...Okay. Okay! Wish me luck!"
string SS_3 "It worked! They're blushing at each other from across the park."
string SS_4 "It didn't go perfectly... but they agreed to have tea. That's a start!"
string SS_5 "@T asked about me? From across the river? ...Well. I suppose it's time we talked."
string SS_6 "@T's eyes glow red. A voice that isn't theirs whispers: \"Go away, little hero.\""
string SS_7 "*CLICK!* A perfect shot. Bring it back!"
string SS_8 "Found them! The little critter wiggles happily in your arms. Bring them home!"
string SS_9 "You found it! Bring it back to its owner."
string SS_10 "Victory! Go tell them the good news."
string SS_11 "You'll get them next time. Catch your breath first."
string SS_12 "The demon @D is cast out! @T is free. Go tell the good news."
string SS_13 "@T's soul could not be saved. Their friends will want to know..."
string SS_14 "The demon clings on. Try again when you're ready."
